OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine on offer leading to a
OL,7,Ffairly clear night initially. Turning
OL,8,Fcloudier from the southeast through
OL,9,Fthe early hours, with a few showers
OL,10,Fpossible by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FSome early brightness in the
OL,13,Fnorth, but cloud thickening to bring
OL,14,Fshowery rain to most areas during the
OL,15,Fmorning. Rain petering out in the
OL,16,Fafternoon, with some brighter spells
OL,17,Freturning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
