OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FUnsettled through Tuesday and
OL,7,FWednesday with cloudy skies, patchy
OL,8,Frain and brisk winds at times,
OL,9,Fespecially around coasts. Brighter
OL,10,Fspells on Thursday, but with showers
OL,11,Fstill likely. Perhaps windy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
